{"On a cache miss, getForLogin loads IdentityProviderModels from the delegate to extract internal IDs, then refetches each ID via session.identityProviders().getById causing N+1 storage reads during cache warm-up": 0.4123309552669525, "OrganizationCacheTest.testCacheIDPForLogin registers cleanup using identityProviders().get(\"alias\") rather than the dynamically created IDP aliases (like \"idp-alias-0\"), so created IDPs are not removed and can pollute subsequent tests causing flakiness": 0.9736748337745667, "InfinispanIdentityProviderStorageProvider.remove performs an unconditional idpDelegate.getByAlias(alias) even when the IDP is present in the cache, adding an avoidable storage lookup to every remove call": 0.6460453271865845, "getForLogin stores results for each distinct organizationId inside a single IdentityProviderListQuery per (realm, FetchMode), accumulating searchKeys indefinitely until invalidation, causing unbounded memory growth in realms with many organizations": 0.5089287757873535}